WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.221 --> 00:00:17.302
Jack and Mara pushed Roxy into a cell.

2
00:00:18.962 --> 00:00:20.043
Mr. Sweeps smiled.

3
00:00:20.063 --> 00:00:22.644
"Now you'll never stop me."

4
00:00:23.564 --> 00:00:25.265
He slammed the heavy iron door.

5
00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:29.146
Roxy heard him lock it.

6
00:00:30.407 --> 00:00:31.808
Roxy thought about the ring Mr.

7
00:00:31.848 --> 00:00:32.648
Sweeps was wearing.

8
00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:35.922
"He's using that ring to control everyone.

9
00:00:36.862 --> 00:00:38.003
I need to destroy it."

10
00:00:39.344 --> 00:00:40.645
Roxy looked around the cell.

11
00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:44.187
"I could break down that door," she thought.

12
00:00:44.207 --> 00:00:45.828
"But Mr.

13
00:00:45.888 --> 00:00:46.809
Sweeps will hear me.

14
00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.551
I need a way to sneak up on him."

15
00:00:51.072 --> 00:00:53.594
Roxy kicked at the rock floor to see how hard it was.

16
00:00:53.614 --> 00:00:57.777
"I think I have an idea."

17
00:00:59.758 --> 00:01:02.480
Mr. Sweeps was examining a diamond when he heard a crash.

18
00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:09.022
"Rocket Girl is trying to break out of her cell," he yelled.

19
00:01:09.042 --> 00:01:11.544
"Everyone, guard the door!"

20
00:01:12.765 --> 00:01:14.286
All the students dropped their tools.

21
00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:18.229
They gathered in front of the cell door.

22
00:01:19.089 --> 00:01:21.391
Boom! There was a deep rumbling sound.

23
00:01:22.391 --> 00:01:23.812
The entire cavern shook.

24
00:01:23.832 --> 00:01:28.636
"As soon as Rocket Girl comes out, capture her!"

25
00:01:29.056 --> 00:01:29.796
commanded Mr.

26
00:01:29.836 --> 00:01:32.378
Sweeps. Suddenly—kaboom!

27
00:01:33.319 --> 00:01:34.840
Pieces of rock flew everywhere.

28
00:01:35.848 --> 00:01:38.369
Roxy blasted through the cavern floor behind everyone.

29
00:01:41.511 --> 00:01:44.493
Mr. Sweeps spun around, but he wasn't fast enough.

30
00:01:45.473 --> 00:01:48.655
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

31
00:01:49.395 --> 00:01:50.436
The ring exploded.

32
00:01:50.456 --> 00:01:52.217
"My ring!"

33
00:01:52.537 --> 00:01:53.077
cried Mr.

34
00:01:53.137 --> 00:01:57.040
Sweeps. Instantly the students' buttons stopped glowing.

35
00:01:59.661 --> 00:02:00.561
"Where are we?"

36
00:02:00.922 --> 00:02:01.462
asked Jack.

37
00:02:01.482 --> 00:02:04.143
"What's going on, Rocket Girl?"

38
00:02:04.464 --> 00:02:05.104
asked Mara.

39
00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.341
"You were all hypnotized by Mr.

40
00:02:08.421 --> 00:02:09.982
Sweeps," answered Roxy.

41
00:02:10.002 --> 00:02:12.443
"He isn't really a principal.

42
00:02:12.803 --> 00:02:15.705
He was forcing you to mine diamonds here under the school."

43
00:02:19.807 --> 00:02:23.209
right," said Detective Smith, who had just walked into the cavern.

44
00:02:23.229 --> 00:02:26.351
"And now Sweeps is going to jail!"

45
00:02:29.993 --> 00:02:31.934
In a flash Rocket Girl disappeared.

46
00:02:33.975 --> 00:02:35.416
A moment later Roxy appeared.

47
00:02:36.404 --> 00:02:40.868
She was wearing her regular clothes and her star button.

48
00:02:40.928 --> 00:02:41.909
"What happened?"

49
00:02:42.229 --> 00:02:45.572
she mumbled, pretending she'd been hypnotized too.

50
00:02:46.593 --> 00:02:48.394
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

51
00:02:52.497 --> 00:02:55.240
The next morning Principal Penn and the teachers were back at work.

52
00:02:56.621 --> 00:02:59.423
"It looks like things are back to normal," said Mara.

53
00:03:00.464 --> 00:03:01.965
"I'm glad," said Jack.

54
00:03:01.985 --> 00:03:05.128
"I'd rather learn than work in that diamond mine."

55
00:03:06.648 --> 00:03:07.389
"You know what else?"

56
00:03:07.749 --> 00:03:08.329
asked Mara.

57
00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:10.791
"We can go to the zoo!

58
00:03:11.912 --> 00:03:14.935
My mom told me our school has money for field trips now."

59
00:03:17.177 --> 00:03:18.558
"Where did the money come from?"

60
00:03:18.818 --> 00:03:19.599
Terrell asked.

61
00:03:19.619 --> 00:03:23.502
"Principal Penn is going to sell the diamonds!"

62
00:03:23.902 --> 00:03:24.523
said Mara.

63
00:03:25.584 --> 00:03:27.205
"Wow!" said Terrell.

64
00:03:27.225 --> 00:03:30.327
"I told you Rocket Girl can do anything.

65
00:03:31.328 --> 00:03:33.070
She helped our school get money!"

66
00:03:34.071 --> 00:03:35.472
Roxy didn't say a word.
